language:
  rust:
    surfaces:
      - path: rust/Cargo.toml
    build_defaults:
      exceptions:
        - clauses: [BD-002, BD-004, BD-008]
          route: tools/dev-fast/config.toml
          adr: docs/adr-012-linux-dev-fast-routing.md
          rationale: >-
            The stable MSRV pin and the published wheels, built in manylinux
            containers that carry no fast linker, must keep the platform linker and the
            LLVM backend, so the linker, the parallel frontend and Cranelift live
            in an explicit fragment that only the non-release Linux develop, test-rust,
            lint-clippy and dev-* routes select.
          review_trigger: >-
            Revisit when the wheel build images carry the fast linker, or when the
            dev-fast nightly or the linker pin moves.
